The long-running part is the mandated structure-aware guess sampling; it is still progressing without errors. The planted checks completed before that stage, and I’m waiting for the reference scan and attack totals rather than weakening the 200,000-sample requirement.
diff --git a/gen_1602_00291.py b/gen_1602_00291.py
